Keep a shared cells as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared visited as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared area as 0.
Keep a shared best as 0.
The picture is "0010000100000,0000000111000,0110100000000,0100110010100,0100110011100,0000000000100,0000000111000,0000000110000".
The rows is split picture by ",".
For each band in rows.
For every column from 0 to 12.
The digit is the digit value of character column of band.
Place digit into cells.

For every spot from 0 to 103.
Place 0 into visited.

To sink from node (a whole number).
If node is less than 0, return.
If item node of visited is 1, return.
If item node of cells is 0, return.
Set item node of visited to 1.
Add 1 to area.
The rowspot is node divided by 13.
The columnspot is node modulo 13.
If rowspot is more than 0, sink from node minus 13.
If rowspot is less than 7, sink from node plus 13.
If columnspot is more than 0, sink from node minus 1.
If columnspot is less than 12, sink from node plus 1.

To probe from node (a whole number).
Set area to 0.
Sink from node.
If area is more than best, set best to area.

For every node from 0 to 103.
If item node of cells is 1 and item node of visited is 0, probe from node.

Show best.
